Package: tavli
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libsecret-1-0, libepoxy0
Recommends: gnome-keyring | kwalletmanager, pulseaudio-utils, ffmpeg, xdg-utils
Description: Tavli - planer obroka
 Recepti, plan obroka, nabavka i ostava. Za prijavu je potreban nalog;
 sesija se čuva u sistemskom keyring-u (Secret Service, npr. GNOME
 Keyring ili KWallet). Diktiranje recepata koristi parecord i ffmpeg.
